ble reservation.\"}],\"projectButton\":\"View project\",\"projectAll\":\"View all projects →\",\"projectsFeaturedTitle\":\"completed\",\"projectsFeaturedGhost\":\"projects\",\"projectsCount\":\"projects\",\"projectsScrollHint\":\"scroll\",\"projectsScrollHintExtra\":\"to scroll through the stack\",\"fpOutro\":{\"eyebrow\":\"(That was the whole stack)\",\"title\":\"Have an idea?\",\"subtitle\":\"Let\\'s collect it\",\"btnAllProjects\":\"All projects\",\"btnOrder\":\"Place an order\"},\"services\":{\"ariaLabel\":\"Services\",\"eyebrow\":\"(Services - what we do)\",\"titleMain\":\"Full cycle\",\"titleGhost\":\"development\",\"meta\":\"06 directions - from landing to real-time systems\",\"cta\":\"Discuss task\",\"link\":\"Discuss the service\",\"stack\":\"technologies in a stack\"},\"servicesFeatured\":[{\"id\":\"web-development\",\"num\":\"01\",\"title\":\"Web Development\",\"description\":\"Creation of modern websites, corporate portals and web applications - from landing pages to complex digital platforms.\",\"tech\":[\"HTML5\",\"CSS3\",\"SCSS\",\"JavaScript\",\"React\",\"Laravel\"],\"accent\":\"#C9F31D\"},{\"id\":\"backend-engineering\",\"num\":\"02\",\"title\":\"Backend Engineering\",\"description\":\"Development of server logic, REST API, microservices, integrations and reliable data processing systems.\",\"tech\":[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"REST API\",\"Redis\",\"PostgreSQL\"],\"accent\":\"#7C6CFF\"},{\"id\":\"frontend-development\",\"num\":\"03\",\"title\":\"Frontend Development\",\"description\":\"Development of fast and responsive interfaces with modern architecture, animations and adaptive layout.\",\"tech\":[\"React\",\"TypeScript\",\"Responsive Design\",\"Animations\"],\"accent\":\"#FF6B4A\"},{\"id\":\"system-architecture\",\"num\":\"04\",\"title\":\"System Architecture\",\"description\":\"Design application architecture, APIs and databases with performance and scalability in mind.\",\"tech\":[\"Architecture\",\"Performance\",\"Database Design\",\"API Design\"],\"accent\":\"#33D6A6\"},{\"id\":\"realtime-systems\",\"num\":\"05\",\"title\":\"Real-time Systems\",\"description\":\"Development of chats, notification systems, corporate messengers and other real-time services.\",\"tech\":[\"WebSocket\",\"RabbitMQ\",\"Matrix Synapse\",\"Messaging Systems\"],\"accent\":\"#FFB03A\"},{\"id\":\"project-support\",\"num\":\"06\",\"title\":\"Project Support\",\"description\":\"Development of existing projects, performance optimization, bug fixes and introduction of new functionality.\",\"tech\":[\"Refactoring\",\"Optimization\",\"Bug Fixing\",\"Feature Development\"],\"accent\":\"#4AA8FF\"}],\"about\":{\"ariaLabel\":\"About me\",\"eyebrow\":\"( about me — experience, architecture, responsibility )\",\"titleMain\":\"A journey\",\"titleGhost\":\"through dozens of projects\",\"paragraphs\":[\"Over the years I have gone through practically all stages of web development. I built projects from scratch and enhanced existing systems, delivered more than fifty web projects of various scales entirely from zero, maintained legacy code, developed new modules, integrated third‑party services and payment systems, and contributed to the growth of large commercial products. More than once I had to fix the consequences of poor architectural decisions, which is why today I clearly understand how important it is to lay a solid foundation already at the design stage.\",\"Working with different CMS platforms, including OpenCart, Shop‑Script and others, I gradually realized that many projects lack a simple, universal and convenient solution. This led to the idea of my own CMS — a lightweight, fast and easily maintainable platform that could be used equally effectively for a small landing page or a corporate site, a restaurant or a construction company. Over time more than fifteen projects were implemented on it, and the development itself became an excellent school of architectural thinking, designing universal components and building systems aimed at long‑term growth.\",\"This experience taught me to look at development more broadly than just writing code. When you design a platform yourself, you begin to treat architecture, scalability, extensibility and the quality of each decision differently. That is when you realize that good code should not only work today, but also remain clear, easy to maintain and ready for new tasks years later.\",\"While developing my own CMS, I constantly looked for ways to make the system more universal and convenient for growth. Many solutions that seemed promising at the time later became standard practice and appeared in other modern CMS. This only confirmed that a solid engineering approach remains relevant regardless of the specific platform.\",\"Over these years I have worked both independently, being fully responsible for a project from idea to launch, and as part of teams where I contributed to the development of large products, long‑term support and design of new modules. Thanks to broad practical experience I can easily master new technologies and quickly join projects with an unfamiliar stack. React, Next.js, Node.js or any other modern tool for me is primarily a means to solve a task, not a goal in itself. It is much more important to understand the principles of building applications and engineering approaches, which is why switching between technologies happens quickly and without loss of development quality.\"],\"note\":\"Behind every successful product there once stood an idea. If you are looking for a developer who can help turn it into a reliable, scalable and maintainable system — I will be glad to discuss your project.\",\"asideTitle\":\"Focus at work\",\"highlights\":[{\"key\":\"architecture\",\"label\":\"Architecture and solid project foundation\"},{\"key\":\"legacy\",\"label\":\"Enhancing existing systems and legacy code\"},{\"key\":\"integrations\",\"label\":\"Integrations of third‑party services and payments\"},{\"key\":\"adaptation\",\"label\":\"Fast immersion int